capability complete-api-run
intent: Complete a run the declared API executed asynchronously. The hosting facade invokes it once the run's worker delivery has ended, its run.exited event is shaped and its trace chunks are appended, with the completion input its execute-run directive declares (runId, admittedAt, capability), the run.exited event project-api-run-events answered, the delivery's answer as it came, and what the facade observed: the run's start time and the last cursor of its appended trace. The facade decides none of what is kept: this declaration composes it from the state, exit code, failure and end time run.exited carries, and the output the delivery answered when the run completed. An output that is not an object or an array is not kept, because the run store stages only those (sfx-dal evidence.stage_run_output), so storing one waits on sfx-dal. The run store stages the output by digest and completes the run (state, capability, exit code, failure and timing) for writer sfx-api, with latestCursor the last cursor of its appended trace, so the store marks the trace complete when the chunks cover 1 to latestCursor.
outcome: status COMPLETED with the run id, its state and whether its trace is complete
inquiry: Was this run completed in the run store?
input contract complete-api-run-request.v1 {"type":"object","required":["runId","exited","delivery","latestCursor"]}
output contract complete-api-run-result.v1 {"type":"object"}
cli display outcome as json
scenario complete-api-run root terminal
given: the run's declared completion input, its run.exited event, its delivery's answer, its start time and the last appended cursor
when: the declaration composes what the run store keeps, and the run store stages the output and completes the run
then: the outcome is the completed run
operation complete-api-run.prepare kind invoke-port port complete-api-run-prepare
operation complete-api-run.complete-prepare kind invoke-port port complete-api-run-complete-prepare
operation complete-api-run.complete kind invoke-port port complete-api-run-complete
operation complete-api-run.answer kind invoke-port port complete-api-run-answer
platform bind complete-api-run-prepare
platform: sda-authority-transformation-port.v1
config: {"expression":{"op":"let","bindings":{"p":{"op":"path","path":"exited.payload"},"output":{"op":"path","path":"delivery.outcome.result.outcome"}},"value":{"op":"merge","values":[{"op":"object","fields":{"runId":{"op":"path","path":"runId"},"admittedAt":{"op":"path","path":"admittedAt"},"capability":{"op":"path","path":"capability"},"state":{"op":"path","path":"state","from":"p"},"exitCode":{"op":"path","path":"exitCode","from":"p"},"startedAt":{"op":"path","path":"startedAt"},"endedAt":{"op":"path","path":"endedAt","from":"p"}}},{"op":"if","when":{"op":"equals","left":{"op":"type","value":{"op":"path","path":"failure","from":"p"}},"right":{"op":"literal","value":"null"}},"then":{"op":"literal","value":null},"else":{"op":"object","fields":{"failure":{"op":"path","path":"failure","from":"p"}}}},{"op":"if","when":{"op":"if","when":{"op":"structural-equals","left":{"op":"path","path":"state","from":"p"},"right":{"op":"literal","value":"completed"}},"then":{"op":"includes","in":{"op":"literal","value":["object","array"]},"value":{"op":"type","value":{"op":"path","path":"","from":"output"}}},"else":{"op":"literal","value":false}},"then":{"op":"object","fields":{"output":{"op":"path","path":"","from":"output"}}},"else":{"op":"literal","value":null}},{"op":"object","fields":{"latestCursor":{"op":"path","path":"latestCursor"}}}]}}}
platform bind complete-api-run-complete-prepare
platform: sda-authority-transformation-port.v1
config: {"expression":{"op":"object","fields":{"executionTarget":{"op":"literal","value":"sql-database-reader"},"executionNamespace":{"op":"literal","value":"sidefx:capabilities"},"executionScenario":{"op":"literal","value":"sql-database-reader"},"inputType":{"op":"literal","value":"json"},"dispatchRequest":{"op":"object","fields":{"dataSource":{"op":"literal","value":"sfx-identity-database"},"statement":{"op":"literal","value":"SET NOCOUNT ON; DECLARE @staged TABLE(value nvarchar(max)); DECLARE @digest varchar(64) = NULL; IF JSON_QUERY(@input, '$.output') IS NOT NULL BEGIN INSERT @staged EXEC evidence.stage_run_output @input = @input; SET @digest = (SELECT TOP (1) JSON_VALUE(value, '$.outputDigest') FROM @staged); END; DECLARE @run nvarchar(max) = (SELECT JSON_VALUE(@input, '$.runId') AS runId, JSON_VALUE(@input, '$.state') AS state, JSON_QUERY(@input, '$.capability') AS capability, TRY_CONVERT(int, JSON_VALUE(@input, '$.exitCode')) AS exitCode, JSON_QUERY(@input, '$.failure') AS failure, JSON_VALUE(@input, '$.startedAt') AS startedAt, JSON_VALUE(@input, '$.endedAt') AS endedAt, CONVERT(bit, 0) AS partial, JSON_QUERY((SELECT CONVERT(bit, CASE WHEN @digest IS NULL THEN 0 ELSE 1 END) AS available FOR JSON PATH, WITHOUT_ARRAY_WRAPPER)) AS output FOR JSON PATH, WITHOUT_ARRAY_WRAPPER); DECLARE @complete nvarchar(max) = (SELECT JSON_VALUE(@input, '$.runId') AS runId, N'sfx-api' AS writerId, JSON_VALUE(@input, '$.admittedAt') AS admittedAt, @digest AS outputDigest, COALESCE(TRY_CONVERT(bigint, JSON_VALUE(@input, '$.latestCursor')), 0) AS latestCursor, JSON_QUERY(@run) AS run FOR JSON PATH, WITHOUT_ARRAY_WRAPPER); EXEC evidence.complete_staged_run @input = @complete;"},"resultColumn":{"op":"literal","value":"value"},"input":{"op":"path","path":""}}}}}}
platform bind complete-api-run-complete
platform: generic-capability-invocation.v1
config: {"providerId":"generic-capability-invocation","authoritySource":"DATABASE","capabilityIdPath":"executionTarget","namespacePath":"executionNamespace","scenarioPath":"executionScenario","requestPath":"dispatchRequest","resultPath":"result","lineageMode":"retain-nested-execution"}
platform bind complete-api-run-answer
platform: sda-authority-transformation-port.v1
config: {"expression":{"op":"if","when":{"op":"equals","left":{"op":"type","value":{"op":"path","path":"result.value"}},"right":{"op":"literal","value":"string"}},"then":{"op":"let","bindings":{"parsed":{"op":"try-parse-json","value":{"op":"path","path":"result.value"},"stripBom":true}},"value":{"op":"path","path":"value","from":"parsed"}},"else":{"op":"if","when":{"op":"equals","left":{"op":"type","value":{"op":"path","path":"result.value"}},"right":{"op":"literal","value":"object"}},"then":{"op":"path","path":"result.value"},"else":{"op":"path","path":"result"}}}}
